  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Matrix: Strengthening the Value of Migrant Associations in Spain</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening the network of migrant associations in Spain and their active participation in the Spanish society, through training activities on topics related to project development and implementation. The project will promote a participatory process of migrant associations, involving them in the process of designing this intervention itself.</narrative>
  </description>
